      "en": "Unofficial Mistral Vibe Code for Magpie. Sign in through Mistral Console or use a Vibe CLI key. Calls chat/completions on api.mistral.ai and supports multi-turn tool calls. Shows the plan, monthly Vibe usage, reset and pay-as-you-go status for the selected account. Alternative to #871: both use the mistral-vibe provider and the same monthly Vibe budget, so enable one.",
      "zh": "非官方 Mistral Vibe Code 插件。通过 Mistral Console 浏览器登录或使用 Vibe CLI Key，调用 api.mistral.ai 的 chat/completions，支持多轮工具调用。可查看当前账号的套餐、月度 Vibe 用量、重置时间与按量付费状态。与 #871 二选一：两者共用 mistral-vibe 供应商与同一月度 Vibe 额度，请只启用一个。"
    }
  },
